Subject: Clang driver Fil-C Linux core (pizfix/optfil, sarcasm, JIT CRT, version scripts, linker)
Upstream-Base: llvmorg-22.1.8 (ca7933e47d3a3451d81e72ac174dcb5aa28b59d1)
Fil-C-Head: cede3de02b42b58a14acc9ce39c9894ab952a915 (branch deluge)

Implements the Fil-C Linux Clang driver: pizfix/optfil sysroot and include
resolution, --filc-* path override flags, SARCASM default assembler and
-yolo-assembler escape hatch, -enable-filc-jit CRT selection, static-PIE
default for -static, pizlonated version scripts, and Fil-C/yolo runtime
link order. Excludes Cosmopolitan/Fat-APE support (split into optional 06b).

